{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20377",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 4.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.6,
      "end_seconds": 10.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "So, of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.29,
      "end_seconds": 22.75,
      "duration_seconds": 11.46,
      "text": "mainly a band-like headache there's a couple of other things, but that's the main one i thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.19,
      "end_seconds": 27.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.17,
      "end_seconds": 35.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.62,
      "end_seconds": 60.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 126 over 75, pulse 70, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.25,
      "end_seconds": 65.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "um, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.45,
      "end_seconds": 69.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.92,
      "end_seconds": 83.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.97,
      "end_seconds": 89.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "hmm, it's been two months now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.14,
      "end_seconds": 93.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.46,
      "end_seconds": 96.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Mild, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.72,
      "end_seconds": 100.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Is it constant or in episodes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.03,
      "end_seconds": 123.54,
      "duration_seconds": 22.51,
      "text": "I'd say a few times a day. Ah, and there's a bit of nausea as well, four weeks now. As for bit of nausea, it's moderate, honestly. Trouble sleeping was there, you know, but it's gone away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.84,
      "end_seconds": 130.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Have you had a band-like headache before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.4,
      "end_seconds": 138.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "yes, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.65,
      "end_seconds": 145.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "Did you get jaw pain on chewing, fever, head injury or blurred vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.43,
      "end_seconds": 154.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.71,
      "text": "I haven't had jaw pain on chewing, fever, head injury or blurred vision, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.62,
      "end_seconds": 159.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.9,
      "end_seconds": 167.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, uh, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.14,
      "end_seconds": 190.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.69,
      "end_seconds": 202.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.47,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day. I live with my elderly mother. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.09,
      "end_seconds": 206.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.67,
      "end_seconds": 209.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.81,
      "end_seconds": 213.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.94,
      "end_seconds": 227.97,
      "duration_seconds": 12.03,
      "text": "Actually, it's sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed. Escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day. It's clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.98,
      "end_seconds": 232.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.98,
      "end_seconds": 234.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "About about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.68,
      "end_seconds": 238.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.17,
      "end_seconds": 250.69,
      "duration_seconds": 10.52,
      "text": "Right, yes, I had two stents put in my heart, three years ago. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.88,
      "end_seconds": 254.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.29,
      "end_seconds": 257.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Yes, migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.02,
      "end_seconds": 258.87,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.67,
      "end_seconds": 266.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had anxiety, yes. I, I have heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.2,
      "end_seconds": 272.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Okay, I can see anxiety in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.33,
      "end_seconds": 279.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "let me look at the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.76,
      "end_seconds": 282.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.43,
      "end_seconds": 304.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Neck muscles are tight and tender, and the eye and limb checks are normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.74,
      "end_seconds": 318.58,
      "duration_seconds": 10.84,
      "text": "that's all I needed to check okay, so my impression is this: The most likely explanation is tension-type headaches with possible medication overuse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.24,
      "end_seconds": 324.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Mm, uh, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.06,
      "end_seconds": 332.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like tension-type headaches with possible medication overuse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.23,
      "end_seconds": 349.07,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "Short breaks from the screen every hour and some neck stretches. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.64,
      "end_seconds": 351.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}